Id: threecmt-infusion
Title: Three-compartment model, zero-order infusion
Structure: ADVAN11 TRANS4
Regimen: infusion
Formats: nonmem,rxode2,mrgsolve
Source: Written for zupkpmx from the PREDPP ADVAN11 TRANS4 structure
